2. The Chromium Project (chromium)
================================================================================

Upstream:   https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/
License:    BSD 3-Clause ("Copyright The Chromium Authors")

CastMirror incorporates a small number of constants and default values
described in Chromium's Cast mirroring service. The following files reference
Chromium as the source of specific values (cited in their header comments):

  core/CastConstants.kt
      default mirroring settings / constants, from
      components/mirroring/service/mirror_settings.cc
  core/discovery/CastDevice.kt
      the default device-capability constant kDefaultDeviceCapabilities = 6149

